The '''North Pole''' (Japanese: '''{{tt|サンタの島|サンタのしま}}''' ''Santa's Island'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location that is the location of [[Santa Claus]]'s home and workshop. It appeared in ''[[Holiday Hi-Jynx]]''. The island is made primarily of ice structures.

[[File:Santa Workshop.png|left|220px|thumb|Santa's workshop]]

In ''[[Holiday Hi-Jynx]]'', after finding one of Santa's lost {{p|Jynx}}, {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} headed for the North Pole to take it home. Due to the long journey there, a {{p|Lapras}} helping Santa find his lost Jynx escorted them to the island.

Santa's workshop is the main feature of the island, resembling a gigantic icy [[Christmas]] tree from the outside. Inside is a factory-like environment full of Jynx workers making toys.
